WEBVTT

00:39:59.371 --> 00:40:00.871
Holy crap. That was unbelievable.

00:40:01.663 --> 00:40:05.121
Way too generous, but your your words
are incredibly appreciated.

00:40:05.121 --> 00:40:09.371
And and again, thank you for this amazing
book and your kind words.

00:40:13.454 --> 00:40:15.371
WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant.

00:40:15.746 --> 00:40:20.496
Our team includes Colin Helmes, Greg Achen
, Dan O'Donnell, Constanza Guardo,

00:40:20.788 --> 00:40:25.663
Joanne DeLuna, Grace Rubenstein, Michelle
Quint, Angela Chang and Anna Felin.

00:40:26.496 --> 00:40:30.329
This episode was produced by Jessica
Glaser and supported by Viking Penguin.